#: setup.php:178
msgid "Enter how many days, weeks or months to keep alert history, or choose Indefinitely to keep everything (the number is then ignored). Maximum 3650 days, 520 weeks or 120 months. A purge job runs with the Cacti poller and removes aged events with their decisions, deliveries and attempts. Active conditions and queued or failed work are never purged. Each collector purges its own history."
